{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_st02","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_st02","title":"衝破藩籬","storyCode":"OF-ST2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st02.txt","sourceHash":"a98b1e2a0406d7182c5ca96c09dbdd24a2db13982f75c911ab8cc756099984bf","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"艾雅法拉透過遠程通訊印證了眾人的猜想。\n一番討論後，眾人決定了接下來的行動方針。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_volcano"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後，根據同位素的對比情況以及多種樣本的最終分析，基本可以確認你們的猜想是對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山活動頻率確實處於一個異常的爬升狀態，雖然不至於馬上爆發天災，但是並不能對其視而不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山活動應該會在二至四周之內到達臨界點，之後就會引起火山天災的爆發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能的話，最好馬上安排市民進行避難準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......以上，就是根據你們給出的情報得出的結論。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是艾雅法拉，隔著聯絡竟然也能整整說了40分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你聽懂了嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感覺就像什麼都沒說一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我也覺得，反應過來的時候好像就結束了。"}]},{"label":"嗯，結論我懂。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，博士真厲害，我完完全全沒有聽明白......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"看那邊那兩個人的樣子，我還以為只有我聽不懂呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是艾雅法拉，連我都重新上了一課呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，不愧是專家，收集的這些資料原來還能從這個方向解讀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到在這裡能夠學到這樣的知識，天哪，我應該全部用筆記下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然目前情報還比較有限，不過我的判斷和你們是一樣的，這座火山很有可能已經從休眠狀態進入了活化狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我不在現場，沒辦法對於火山的活動原因進行進一步的探索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，如果有更多的現場情報我們甚至能找到火山活動的契機，更精確地確定活動的周期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果那樣的話也能方便市民們做好轉移安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都明白你對火山的執著，艾雅法拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經幫了我們大忙了。辛苦你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"有你們這樣專業的團隊幫助我進行確認實在是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因為儀器的問題，汐斯塔的觀測點一直都讀不出任何資料異常來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"看來為此我的東奔西走還是值得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得趕快把這些消息帶給市政府才行，不然後果肯定不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思不會是說，汐斯塔市在這個時候舉辦了如此大規模的節日活動，卻一點天災的準備都沒有吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"現在別說準備了，市民和遊客甚至連天災有可能產生都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我父親在三個月前前往新開發區進行工作了，要在幾天後才能回來，現在城裡大大小小的事情都交給了他的秘書克洛寧處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"而克洛寧也是這座城市的天災信使，我們只需要現在回去市政府，帶回資料和其他樣本，就可以讓他瞭解情況了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我是市長的女兒，但是關於城市政府的事情我並沒有太多參與。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在既然已經得到了確實的證明，就可以讓家裡的人幫助我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我有一個想法，我去火山進一步確認情況，我想試著找一找艾雅法拉提到的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭這邊能拜託你和其他人嗎？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"進入火山？那也太危險了？！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"天災信使的工作總是危險的，放心吧，在這方面我還是很有經驗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然遠端通訊只能在旅館進行，不過我會隨時和博士保持聯絡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我也和你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"你有什麼意見？我可不放心，萬一你破壞了重要的研究資料怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然是要跟你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，沒有意見沒有意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，我們需要通知一下阿米婭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"不用啦。小事一樁而已，有博士知道就夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此那我們就說定了，博士。也請你準備一下資料，我們下午兩點就出發去市政廳。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒問題。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，事情定下來後，總算可以稍微放鬆一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我這裡有一些從維多利亞帶來的茶葉，來喝一杯茶吧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好吧。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你一定會喜歡的。"}]},{"label":"不必了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"是不會泡茶嗎？那我親手幫你泡一杯吧。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好吧。","value":"4","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，我想你一定會喜歡的。"}]},{"label":"......不必了。","value":"5","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個麻煩的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是在維多利亞中數一數二的茶葉哦？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"敗給你了。","value":"6","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了，我想你一定會喜歡的。"}]},{"label":"............不必了。","value":"7","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我的泡茶手藝可是很好的，不嘗一下會抱憾終身哦？"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"...................好吧。","value":"8","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個頑固的人，非要我這麼說才能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，請稍等片刻。"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
